		(uuid "764c1e0b-2770-4625-8b6e-f30750d48b60")
	)
	(text "LED DRIVE: 249R (E96, 1%) -- FINDING F1, 2026-08-16. Was 430R, which"
		(at 340.36 100.33 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9d731fff-4fe4-4c67-983e-1c9462d7d652")
	)
	(text "under-drove all 24 of these LEDs: ~5mA worst case against the ACSL-6xx0's own"
		(at 340.36 105.41 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3708a3ec-09db-4526-94eb-99e8a0199cfc")
	)
	(text "7.0mA I_FH minimum, i.e. not guaranteed to switch at all. The original sizing"
		(at 340.36 110.49 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ca71d1af-d8b3-4211-b8fa-133d5ea1f4ff")
	)
	(text "was arithmetically right and physically wrong -- it solved (5.0V - VOL - VF)/I"
		(at 340.36 115.57 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a3a20f82-f6fb-4432-9d02-f2c512724ad8")
	)
	(text "using the rail's NOMINAL 5.00V and VF TYP (1.52V), but +5V reaches these anodes"
		(at 340.36 120.65 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ee469937-eec7-4024-a35e-0c20f2bbf7ab")
	)
	(text "through F4 and D3 (0.38-0.45V of drop, so 4.55-4.62V) and VF's worst case is"
		(at 340.36 125.72999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8a5741e3-6134-4d0b-a660-e16f7bd7babc")
	)
	(text "1.80V. 249R gives 8.6mA worst / 13.7mA best: clear of the 8mA guardbanded floor"
		(at 340.36 130.81 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "bb9bee9b-a9e4-491b-8bc7-4195a82fd7f4")
	)
	(text "(AV02-0235EN footnote b) and of the 15mA ABSOLUTE maximum. 240R was rejected at"
		(at 340.36 135.89 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6ab1a148-cc8a-43ce-96fd-ef6136e2992f")
	)
	(text "99% of that maximum; 270R misses the 8mA floor."
		(at 340.36 140.97 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "b6842e5e-d236-4a74-acad-4695a7ad3722")
	)
